module jev_reverse_observation_receipt

input source_digest
input declaration_digest
input ir_digest
input generated_artifact_digest
input reverse_observation_digest
input observed_stage
input missing_stage
input evidence_prefix_digest

status OBSERVED source, declaration, IR, generation, and reverse observation are linked
status DEFERRED a required provenance stage is not yet observed
status UNKNOWN provenance identity or evidence is missing
status MISMATCH reverse observation does not match the generated artifact

field status
field source_digest
field declaration_digest
field ir_digest
field generated_artifact_digest
field reverse_observation_digest
field observed_stage
field missing_stage
field evidence_prefix_digest
field receipt_digest

constraint source_generation_reverse_chain
constraint prefix_evidence_is_immutable
constraint missing_stage_is_preserved
constraint mismatch_is_not_success
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_catalog_mutation
